# Grouped GEMM harness for configurations that
# harness_grouped_matmul_generated_ci doesn't generate yet (it replaced
# Section A = 2Dx3D and Section B = 2Dx2D):
# Section C = 2Dx2D scaled (fp8 with K-grouped scales)
# Section D = layouts of grouped operands and row-wise 2Dx2D scales
# Section E = 2Dx3D binary post-ops with dense tensors
#
# Grouped operands are 3D with the groups in dim 0, so masks are over src
# {G, M, K} and wei {G, K, N} in both variants
#
# --- Section C: 2Dx2D scaled: fp8 with K-grouped scales ---------------------
# src[M, total_K] (col-major) * wei[total_K, N] -> dst[G, M, N] (dense 3D)
# Scales are a grid over total_K: src [M, total_K/gK], wei [total_K/gK, N/gN].
# Group sizes must be multiples of the scales K group (profiles align to it)

# Unscaled fp8
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16,f8_e5m2:f8_e4m3:f32
--grouped=1:4:balanced
16x64:64x32

# MXFP8: e8m0 scales per 32 K elements
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--dtag=abc,acb
--attr-scales=src:7:e8m0:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1
--grouped=1:4:64+0+128+64
32x256:256x48
--grouped=1:4:balanced,1:4:hot.100
33x256:256x48

# DeepSeek Wgrad: f32 (SM90) or e8m0 (SM100) scales per 128 K elements
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:f32,f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--attr-scales=src:7:f32:1x128+wei:7:f32:128x1,src:7:e8m0:1x128+wei:7:e8m0:128x1
--grouped=1:3:128+0+256
24x384:384x40
--grouped=1:4:balanced
24x512:512x40

# Scale data types (f32, e8m0, f8_e4m3) on src and wei, one-sided scales,
# K and N grouped wei scales
--reset
--dt=f8_e5m2:f8_e5m2:f16
--attr-scales=src:7:f32:1x32+wei:7:f8_e4m3:64x1,src:7:f8_e4m3:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1,src:7:e8m0:1x64+wei:7:f32:32x1,src:7:f8_e4m3:1x32,wei:7:f32:64x16
--grouped=1:4:balanced
32x256:256x48

# Single group, and all tokens in one group
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--attr-scales=src:7:e8m0:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1
--grouped=1:1:balanced,1:6:hot.100
24x96:96x40

# Single K block (gK == total_K) next to empty groups
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--attr-scales=src:7:e8m0:1x32,wei:7:e8m0:32x1,src:7:e8m0:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1
--grouped=1:2:32+0,1:3:0+32+0
16x32:32x16

# --- Section D: layouts of grouped operands and row-wise 2Dx2D scales -------
# `--stag`, `--wtag`, and `--dtag` set to `ab` or `ba` pick the contiguous dim
# of a grouped operand. K-major src (ab) and wei (ba) is the layout of the
# PyTorch _scaled_grouped_mm 2Dx2D

# 2Dx2D: K-major src and wei, unscaled
--reset
--dt=f32:f32:f32,bf16:bf16:bf16
--stag=ab --wtag=ba
--grouped=1:4:balanced,1:6:hot
64x100:100x32

# 2Dx2D MXFP8 in all four layout combinations
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--stag=ab,ba --wtag=ba,ab
--attr-scales=src:7:e8m0:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1
--grouped=1:4:64+0+128+64
32x256:256x48

# 2Dx2D DeepSeek Wgrad in the K-major layout
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:f32
--stag=ab --wtag=ba
--attr-scales=src:7:f32:1x128+wei:7:f32:128x1
--grouped=1:3:128+0+256
24x384:384x40

# 2Dx2D FP8 row-wise: src per group and row [G, M], wei per group and column
# [G, N], also next to K-grouped wei scales
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16,f8_e5m2:f8_e5m2:bf16
--stag=any,ab --wtag=any,ba
--attr-scales=src:3+wei:5,src:3,wei:5,src:3+wei:7:f32:32x1
--grouped=1:4:balanced,1:3:0+32+64
16x96:96x24

# 2Dx3D: column-major src and dst
--reset
--dt=f32:f32:f32,bf16:bf16:bf16
--stag=ba --wtag=abc,acb --dtag=ab,ba
--grouped=0:4:balanced,0:4:hot.100
32x64:4x64x32

# 2Dx3D FP8 row-wise and MXFP8 with column-major src and dst, and bias
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--stag=ba --wtag=acb --dtag=ba
--attr-scales=src:3+wei:5,src:7:e8m0:1x32+wei:7:e8m0:32x1
--bia-dt=undef,f32 --bia_mask=2
--grouped=0:4:balanced
32x128:4x128x64

# --- Section E: 2Dx3D binary post-ops with dense tensors --------------------
# Masks are over the 3D dst {G, M, N}: a dense tensor constant along M is per
# tensor (0), per group (1), per column (4), or per group and column (5)
--reset
--dt=f32:f32:f32,bf16:bf16:bf16
--attr-post-ops=mul:f32:0,mul:f32:1,mul:f32:4,mul:f32:5,mul:f32:5+mul:f32:7:grouped
--grouped=0:4:balanced,0:4:16+0+40+8
64x128:4x128x48

# NVFP4-like per-tensor global scale and per group and column scales
--reset
--dt=f8_e4m3:f8_e4m3:bf16
--wtag=acb
--attr-scales=src:3+wei:5
--attr-post-ops=mul:f32:0,mul:f32:5
--grouped=0:4:balanced
32x64:4x64x32
